{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《2026香港小姐競選》上星期（6月2日）已展開了第一輪面試，當日84位參選佳麗於無綫電視城首晤傳媒，質素燕瘦環肥，風格亦各有不同。今日就是第二輪面試，有多位參選佳麗在大會call time前已提前抵達TVB電視城，拖住行李箱準備在下午進行第二輪面試見TVB高層。據知，早到的6位佳麗是海外佳麗，當中一位名叫盧蔚晴的佳麗身穿黑色喱士透視上衣配低腰牛仔褲，透出bra top與內褲邊搶鏡，成功突圍而出。</p><p>攝：葉志明、陳順禎、陳釗、林迅景</p><figure><img alt=\"(左一) 盧蔚晴。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141345001679360000620153.jpeg/O8v14S5pSx79oiXcgkw-wV_flbL6WD7hiNwHKbLcByk\"/><figcaption>(左一) 盧蔚晴。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141344999426887680816795.jpeg/m__UqtTyDpd7AjG-xsElgVW8goJ2B6EnUFvZBGpb2QQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141344996985671680128347.jpeg/YrXiAR1-GbaqbjpY9qcC3MsWHyzMuLmlp-cokp3nKJI\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141345006419185664915728.jpeg/-P_RxgiuhOnchq1L3zdpj5-01lJJgEaDFtEbbyzRG28\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141345004405788672571860.jpeg/n7qB7TcPkfUmD7zS9jewEzr9rgPGO-apHF9gvSZfYL0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141345002266562560947163.jpeg/FbRmjEvpqvPq7wl-LvZoS9ylKB1zf70oX1tMMWVbTDE\"/><figure><img alt=\"據知這六位是海外佳麗。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141344999963758592137062.jpeg/a1psDeQbiWXKEBPCymxDt-CWTeT18Id4q6jGipGoxoo\"/><figcaption>據知這六位是海外佳麗。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141344997606428672901486.jpeg/4RVqOAzGLur4pP8eJe-QlqJlbtfE4TFr4F65tNpeubQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141345006213664768902873.jpeg/iAxA6wquAGJvCdheQYFSwFDcPbK0w0csjSfN97cnzfc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141345004007329792403796.jpeg/BvZbWBIF8UxIjKOqbv5lMbGIfN4ReZpHk8SAhqnEgIY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141345001926823936804735.jpeg/o5Diq0i5ahqt09ezUzoOEXCEfpJj3GHAoENgR5pDYEc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141344999842123776470812.jpeg/BYxtpK5qZEK1uq6MMUnsoXwZNXzgnJDsuRThnYMU4Z0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141344997602234368973516.jpeg/a3vVNjJ4Lnfsygvvq28GbK-F-EySBHiJL1hRaBVYUWg\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-10T07:20:28.819909+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":239,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}